msgid "Schema.org Article"
msgstr "Schema.org Makalesi"

msgid "Adds Schema.org/Article to the JSON LD array. Creates Article, BlogPosting, SocialMediaPosting, Report, ScholarlyArticle, TechArticle or APIReference."
msgstr "Schema.org/Article öğesini JSON LD dizisine ekler. Article, BlogPosting, SocialMediaPosting, Report, ScholarlyArticle, TechArticle ya da APIReference oluşturur."

